# Per-chart values fixtures live here.
#
# A fixture is OPTIONAL. The smoke test installs every chart in Chart.yaml
# from oci://ghcr.io/verity-org/charts/<name> with default values. Add a
# fixture only when a chart cannot install on a vanilla kind cluster
# (cluster-friendliness tweaks: disable optional subcharts, shrink resource
# requests below kind's budget, work around unsupported features).
#
# Fixture filename convention: <chart-name>.yaml (matching the dependency
# name in Chart.yaml). Optional companion <chart-name>.allowlist.txt lists
# image-ref prefixes the image-origin assertion should accept in addition
# to ghcr.io/verity-org/.
